High-Level 3D Architecture (Coexisting with 2D)
Overview

The architecture reuses the core from Floppy Turd: GameCore::FloppyTurdGame (unchanged base), GameCore::GameStateManager, Gnosis::ECS, and Gnosis::SystemManager (orchestrator).
3D extensions are added modularly, allowing coexistence with 2D systems.
Key flows: FloppyTurdGame connects to ECS, which orchestrates SystemManager. Systems interact with components and delegates.

Subgraphs and Relationships

Game (C++):

Components: GameCore::FloppyTurdGame, GameCore::GameStateManager, Gnosis::ECS, Gnosis::SystemManager.
Connections: FloppyTurdGame -> ECS; ECS -> SystemManager.


3D Systems (C++):

Systems: GameCore3D::SceneGraphSystem, GameCore3D::RenderSystem3D, GameCore3D::AnimationSystem3D (skeletal), GameCore3D::PhysicsSystem3D, GameCore3D::AudioSystem3D (spatial), GameCore3D::InputSystem3D (FP controls), GameCore3D::NetworkingSystem (multiplayer), GameCore3D::DiagnosticsSystem (perf).
Connections: SystemManager -> All 3D Systems.


3D Components (C++):

Components: Transform3D {position: vec3, rotation: quat, scale: vec3}, Hierarchy {parent: Entity, firstChild, nextSibling}, Camera3D {fov, aspect, near, far, projection}, Light {type, color, intensity, range, angle}, MeshRenderer {mesh, material}, SkinnedMesh {mesh, material, skeleton}, Material {shader, textures, params}, Skybox {cubemap}, PhysicsBody3D {mass, drag, kinematic, velocity: vec3, angularVel: vec3}, Collider3D {box/sphere/capsule/mesh, trigger}, AudioSource3D {soundId, position, volume, falloff, spatialBlend, doppler}, NetworkSync {ownerId, predictionMode, syncFrequency}.
Connections: SceneGraphSystem -> Transform3D, Hierarchy; RenderSystem3D -> Transform3D, Camera3D, Light, MeshRenderer, SkinnedMesh, Material, Skybox; PhysicsSystem3D -> PhysicsBody3D, Collider3D; AudioSystem3D -> AudioSource3D; NetworkingSystem -> NetworkSync.


Platform Delegates (C++):

Delegates: GameCore::PlatformDelegates {Renderer3DDelegate, Input3DDelegate, Audio3DDelegate, AssetDelegate (extended), NetworkDelegate, DiagnosticsDelegate}.
Connections: RenderSystem3D -> Renderer3DDelegate (3D calls); InputSystem3D -> Input3DDelegate (input); AudioSystem3D -> Audio3DDelegate (audio); NetworkingSystem -> NetworkDelegate (net); DiagnosticsSystem -> DiagnosticsDelegate (diag). Uses C++/Swift Native Interop for iOS bridging.


iOS (Swift):

Components: GameEngine (Swift), CommandProcessor (Swift), Metal3DRenderer (Swift), ThreadingProxy (C++) - Optimized for Swift 6 Actors.
Connections: CommandProcessor -> ThreadingProxy; ThreadingProxy -> Metal3DRenderer (command buffers); GameEngine -> CommandProcessor; GameEngine -> FloppyTurdGame.


Raylib 3D (C++):

Components: RaylibRenderer3D.
Connections: PlatformDelegates -> RaylibRenderer3D (3D calls).



