Relationships

Metal3DRenderer and RaylibRenderer3D implement IRenderer3D (via delegates/commands).
RenderPipeline composes RenderPass (owns vector).
ForwardPass, ShadowPass, SkyboxPass, UIOverlayPass inherit from RenderPass.

Design Note: Hot path optimized by batching draw commands in ThreadingProxy (e.g., command buffers flushed per frame). For Swift 6, use actors in CommandProcessor for concurrent command queuing without locks.
