Relationships

All delegates are part of GameCore::PlatformDelegates (C++ with Swift interop).
iOS flow: GameplayState -> RenderSystem3D -> ThreadingProxy (enqueue 3D commands); CommandProcessor -> ThreadingProxy (pull commands); CommandProcessor -> Metal3DRenderer (execute setCamera, draw, etc.).

iOS 3D Flow (Textual Sequence)

GameplayState (C++) updates and renders, submitting 3D draw commands to RenderSystem3D.
RenderSystem3D enqueues 3D commands to ThreadingProxy.
CommandProcessor (Swift) pulls getAndClear3DCommands() from ThreadingProxy.
CommandProcessor executes on Metal3DRenderer (setCamera, setLights, draw...).
Metal3DRenderer signals frame done to CommandProcessor.

For multi-threading: Use Swift 6 actors in CommandProcessor for safe concurrent enqueuing; ThreadingProxy batches to minimize cross-thread overhead.
Coexistence With 2D

Existing 2D systems (RenderSystem, SpriteSystem, UISystem) remain intact.
UIOverlayPass renders 2D UI over 3D via shared command queue.
SystemManager updates both 2D and 3D; states opt into either/both.

Migration Outline (Incremental)

Add math types: GNVector3, GNQuaternion, GNMatrix4.
Add components: Transform3D, Camera3D, Light, MeshRenderer, Material, Skybox, PhysicsBody3D, Collider3D, AudioSource3D, NetworkSync.
Add systems: SceneGraphSystem, RenderSystem3D (forward-only first), AnimationSystem3D, PhysicsSystem3D, AudioSystem3D, InputSystem3D, NetworkingSystem, DiagnosticsSystem.
Extend delegates: Renderer3DDelegate, Input3DDelegate, etc., to PlatformDelegates; update ThreadingProxy/CommandProcessor with C++/Swift interop.
Implement iOS: Metal3DRenderer with forward pass; add spatial audio via AVAudioEngine.
Implement Raylib: Map subset to RaylibRenderer3D.

